 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Within and in",
   "texto": [
    "**Через** (within) with accusative indicates when something will happen: **через неделю** (within a week), **через год** (within a year). **За** (in, within) with accusative indicates the time that takes something: **за месяц** (in one month), **за час** (in one hour).",
    "Difference: **Я приеду через неделю** = I'll be there in a week. **Я выучу русский за год** = I'll learn Russian in a year."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Until, after and around",
   "texto": [
    "**До** (up to, before), **после** (after) and **около** (about) go with genitive: **до понедельника** (until Monday), **после работы** (after work), **около месяца** (about a month).",
    "**В течение** (during) also goes with genius: **в течение дня** (during the day)."
   ]
